NorwayRegistryName=Registered name
NorwayRegistryTime=Lookup time
NorwayRegistryVAT=Registered for VAT
NorwayRegistryMatch=The VAT setting matches the registry at this lookup.
NorwayRegistryMismatch=The VAT setting differs from the registry. Investigate registration and its effective date before changing company settings.
