NorwayRegistryDeleted=Company deleted in the registry. VAT status is not confirmed.
NorwayRegistryUnavailable=The registry service did not provide a valid response. VAT status is unknown; try again later.

NorwayAccountingSetup=Chart and accounting setup check
NorwayAccountingScope=Read-only structural check for the active entity and selected chart. An available account or journal does not confirm Norwegian chart suitability, SAF-T mapping, tax treatment or accounting readiness. No accounts or settings are changed.
NorwayAccountingDefaultsScope=Default accounts are fallback mappings in Dolibarr. Product, customer or line mappings may exist without a default; these are not checked here. VAT account presence does not assess registration or deduction rights. Journal counts do not establish which journal a transaction uses.
